<title>EGYPT: SQUASH-RESULT OF FINAL AT AL-AHRAM INTERNATIONAL.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-RESULT OF FINAL AT AL-AHRAM INTERNATIONAL.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final at the al-Ahram International squash championship on Tuesday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>3-Peter Nicol (Scotland) beat 1-Jansher Khan (Pakistan) 12-15 15-14 15-12 15-11</p>
</text>
